# This is an example Manifest.toml file
# The actual Manifest.toml is generated automatically by Julia and should be gitignored
# This file shows what a typical manifest looks like

# To generate the actual manifest:
# julia --project=. -e 'using Pkg; Pkg.instantiate()'

# The manifest will contain:
# - Exact versions of all dependencies
# - Dependency tree
# - Package UUIDs and checksums

# This ensures reproducible builds across different environments


